摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"One upload button plus drag-and-drop files into the conversation as local paths: save to project uploads/, path text into the input box, works with any vision tool","id":"gh:1336505456","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-file-upload","slug":"a903067276-rgb/dsh-file-upload","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","file-upload","web-ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"One upload button plus drag-and-drop files into the conversation as local paths: save to project upl"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"oads/, path text into the input box, works with any vision tool"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-file-upload ⬆️"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**One upload button + drag-and-drop files straight into the conversation** — a plugin for DeepSeek H"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" + drag-and-drop files straight into the conversation** — a plugin for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) web."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"*Unofficial project: independently developed and maintained by a community member, not an official D"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ct: independently developed and maintained by a community member, not an official DeepSeek product.*"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> ## ⚠️ DISCONTINUED (2026-09-10)\n>\n> **dsh 0.1.5-rc.1 ships a built-in attachment system that cover"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"s this plugin's core capability** (attach any file type; the model reads it on demand through its sa"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ved read-only path). This plugin is **no longer maintained**.\n>\n> - **Highest supported DSH version:"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" 0.1.2** (last verified on 0.1.2-rc.1). No further fixes or compatibility work.\n> - **Upgrading to d"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"sh 0.1.5 or newer? You MUST disable/remove this plugin first** — together with 0.1.5's attachment sy"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"stem it breaks the boot (the web app fails to start). Remove `dsh-file-upload` from `dsh.profile.bun"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"dles` in your profile's `package.json` before upgrading.\n> - Thanks to everyone who used it. For fil"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"e attachments, use the official feature (drag or paste files into the composer)."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Action | Effect |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Click upload icon | System file picker (multi-select) → smart routing → attachment rail and/or pat"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"h text |\n| Drag a file into the window | Images & any file type are taken over (no \"unsupported\" toa"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"st) → smart routing |\n| Drag a folder into the window | Recursively reads the whole folder → rebuild"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"s it under the attachment library with its original layout → only the folder path goes into the draf"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"t (contents not expanded) |\n| **Image** (PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF) | ① archived to the **attachment directo"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ry** (by-day folders) ② added to the **official draft attachment rail** → sent with automatic DeepSe"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"ek Files API `file_id` (same image reuses the id; 7-day expiry auto-reuploads) |\n| **Any other file*"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"* | Archived to the library's `files/` subfolder, `<prefix> <path>` text goes into the draft |\n| Mod"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"el without image support | Image falls back to archive + path text (never sent as an image block, no"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"out image support | Image falls back to archive + path text (never sent as an image block, no 400) |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Single-file limit: **64 MB** (DeepSeek Files API hard limit; the local attachment store defaults t"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"o 20 MB — see *Large images* below)\n- Everything lands in the **attachment library**: `~/Documents/D"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"SH/Attachments/images/<YYYY-MM-DD>/` (images) or `.../files/<YYYY-MM-DD>/` (other files) — configura"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ble in Settings\n- Button shows busy state while uploading; failures surface as Chinese notices"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- DSH web >= 0.1.0-rc.7 (run with `dsh web`)\n- **Version compatibility** (best effort — verified loc"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"ally on 0.1.2-alpha.2 / 0.1.2-rc.1 and 0.1.1-rc.2; on 0.1.0-rc.7/rc.8 the official image rail can't "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"be fully checked, **not guaranteed**):\n- **Maintenance policy: DISCONTINUED (2026-09-10)** — superse"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ded by the official attachment system shipped in dsh 0.1.5-rc.1. **Highest supported DSH version: 0."},{"id":"p12s5","text":"1.2.** No further updates."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Your DSH version | Install this | Note |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| **0.1.5 and newer** | ⛔ **do not install** | Replaced by the official attachment system; this plug"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"in breaks the boot — **disable/remove it before upgrading** |\n| 0.1.1-rc.1 – 0.1.2 | `main` (v0.1.5+"},{"id":"p14s3","text":") | Last supported range (full features, including the official image rail) |\n| 0.1.0-rc.7 – 0.1.0-r"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"c.8 | `main` (v0.1.5+) | Works fine; the official image rail auto-degrades to path text unless the s"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"ession model accepts images. Conservative fallback: `v0.1.4` — `dsh plugin add github:a903067276-rgb"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"/dsh-file-upload#v0.1.4` |\n| 0.1.0-rc.6 and older | `v0.1.2` — `dsh plugin add github:a903067276-rgb"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"/dsh-file-upload#v0.1.2` | Last release without the settings card (the card uses the rc.7+ keyed slo"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"oad#v0.1.2` | Last release without the settings card (the card uses the rc.7+ keyed slot contract) |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- No extra shell needed: the host half is pure Node (`node:fs`), no system commands required on any "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"a shell needed: the host half is pure Node (`node:fs`), no system commands required on any platform."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Host** (`lib/index.js`): `POST /api/file-upload/save` — validates the session and size, writes t"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"he base64 payload to `<library>/images/<YYYY-MM-DD>/` (`mode=image`) or `<library>/files/<YYYY-MM-DD"},{"id":"p17s3","text":">/` (`mode=file`) with **pure Node**; `POST /api/file-upload/save-folder` — takes a relative-path + "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"base64 list and rebuilds the tree under `<library>/files/<date>/<timestamp>-<folder>/` (each segment"},{"id":"p17s5","text":" sanitized, `..` rejected to prevent traversal); `GET/POST /api/file-upload/config` reads/writes the"},{"id":"p17s6","text":" settings (official `settings` service) and exposes the host image limit plus whether the current se"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"ssion's model accepts images — resolved from the same model-route source the official UI uses (model"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"-selection projection → request header → `agentDefaultModel`, with the legacy `apiProxy.sessions.mod"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"els` fallback on older DSH releases).\n- **Client** (`lib/client.js`): registers the upload icon in t"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"he `conversation.input.left` seat; capture-phase document listener takes over file drags and reads d"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"ragged folders via `webkitGetAsEntry`; routing: supported image + official on + model supports + wit"},{"id":"p17s12","text":"hin host limit → archive + `conversation.createDraftImages` + `inputActions.addImages` (the official"},{"id":"p17s13","text":" InputBar's own mechanism) → official attachment rail (no path text); anything else degrades to arch"},{"id":"p17s14","text":"ive + path text; >64 MB is refused with a notice.\n- **Error boundary**: a render crash degrades to a"},{"id":"p17s15","text":" small \"⚠ upload component error\" chip instead of unmounting the whole composer."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Why this plugin exists"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"DSH natively rejects dragged-in images when the current model doesn't support them. This plugin rout"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"es images through the **official attachment path** when the model can see them (so they ride the Dee"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"pSeek Files API with `file_id` reuse), keeps a **user-accessible archive copy** you can find later, "},{"id":"p19s4","text":"and falls back to plain **path text** otherwise — a plain-text message that passes the model's image"},{"id":"p19s5","text":" check and works with any model or vision plugin (it bypasses DSH's native image rejection because n"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"o image block is ever submitted on the fallback path)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
